data: {"id": "8c4ca8e2b46e4eb0-thinking-parallel_evidence-1771", "run_id": "8c4ca8e2b46e4eb0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，现在我已经拿到 Pod 的真实状态。`CreateContainerConfigError` 的 **直接原因** 已经很清楚了：\n\n> `couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input`\n\n即 Secret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中缺少密钥 `unavailable-key`。\n\n---\n\n现在处理失败的工具调用：\n\n**失败原因分析：**\n\n`query_pod_logs` 和 `query_pod_tracing` 的失败错误都显示：\n\n```\nError from server (Forbidden): pods \"elasticsearch-master-0\" is forbidden: User \"system:serviceaccount:mcp:mcp-server-manager\" cannot create resource \"pods/exec\" in the namespace \"monitor\"\n```\n\n以及\n\n``", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788427526992, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

