在键并校验失败 (机制) → \nKubernetes 容器创建阶段配置验证失败，进入 CreateContainerConfigError (直接失败) → \nPod 保持 Pending 且容器不可用 (用户可见现象)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：\nPod 容器 `app` 的启动配置中引用了 Secret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中的键 `unavailable-key`，但该 Secret 中实际上并不存在此键（仅存在 `available-key`，根据错误原文推断）。这一配置错误导致 Kubernetes 在尝试创建容器时无法解析挂载配置，从而抛出 `CreateContainerConfigError` 并阻止容器启动。\n\n**证据支撑**：\n- K8s State `container.waiting_message` (Fact 1) 直接指出了具体的缺失键名和所属 Secret。\n- K8s Event (Fact 2) 和 Metrics (Fact 5, 6) 确认了异常仅发生在配置阶段，而非运行时或依赖外部服务（如日志/链路追踪）的可用性问题。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 21.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 59.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2: 59.3s (Evidence 52.5s, RCA 6.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 92.676, "metrics": {"run_id": "8c4ca8e2b46e4eb0", "mttr": {"value": "1.5m", "seconds": 92.67950105667114, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "56%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.9, "weighted_score": 0.18, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 90%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 92679.50105667114, "llm_calls": 19, "llm_duration_ms": 86876.2035369873, "tool_calls": 19, "executed_tool_calls": 19, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 19, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 9278.559923171997, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 5157.781362533569}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 21288.036584854126, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 59316.85495376587, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 12048.91324043274, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

